    "payload": "object 317336fe489d2549292c6db6568a31d5d58a9083\ntype commit\ntag anchor/predicates-2\ntagger Falden <release@falden.ai> 1794463270 -0500\n\nanchor/predicates-2\n\nAnchor #2 of the Falden fixture pack, after the private rehearsal. anchor/predicates-2.manifest records what predicates-1 records, with the rehearsal record's files under freeze/rehearsal/, under a first line naming the build commit it was prepared from. anchor/predicates-2.diff is the change against predicates-1 and anchor/predicates-2.reasons.json gives one reason per changed file. anchor/predicates-2.sig is the release key's signature over the manifest, in namespace falden-fixture-anchor; anchor/predicates-2.tsr (DigiCert) and anchor/predicates-2.tsr2 (GlobalSign) are RFC 3161 tokens over that signature.\n",
